tation  but were unable to provide any further  details about the relationship between  da silva  and costa that said more details have  come out about the potentially  premeditated nature of the crime  according to a statement from gamer's  elite that we translated  costa recorded a video of the murder and  sent it to the gamers elite whatsapp  group on the 22nd  the day that it happened gamer's elite  also said that kosta sent the group  a 52-page document filled with what they  described as hate messages against  christians that incited a hate crime  then a brazilian  english literature professor and also a  feminist blogger  named lola aranovich says that kosta  sent her an email  after the fact with the subject line  quote  commendable act aranovich said that the  email linked to several videos of the  murder  and also promised more attacks she was  also sent the same 52-page document that  gamer's elite was sent  in the document that cost ascent to both  iranovich and his whatsapp group  which the score has acquired he  describes a quote  strong hatred for women end quote that  has developed over the past few years  he also says that the murder was not  vain and that he intends for people to  quote learn from it according to a  follow-up blog post by ronovich she  received a phone call and an email with  more threats on february 24th aranovich  alleges that the caller threatened to  kill her  if she didn't remove mention of a  misogynist online forum  similar to 4chan called crazychan  from her blog on february 28th aranovich  tweeted that she received another phone  call  claiming that quote guillermi was just  the beginning and quote  other attacks will come aronovich also  said that she received an email that  same day  february 28th with photos of another  woman dead in gravada brazil  now the first place that many members of  the english-speaking world  saw the news was a statement from  another brazilian esports organization  called jaguars gigi  here's 